Patch 0001-vllm58815-ple-host-file-gather.patch for vLLM, base commit 77154ca6116ae34cbfe314beef1016bde9b63989 (vllm/vllm-openai:nightly-77154ca6116ae34cbfe314beef1016bde9b63989).
What: Reads the 51.2 GB PLE n-gram table's rows from the checkpoint's safetensors file each step (pread with a 64-worker pool), so the table is never resident and the model fits in 121 GiB.
Upstream: https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/58815 by @Trosfy (open), ported at head a7ebbe5f; adds the parallel preadv pool (VLLM_PLE_FILE_GATHER_WORKERS).
This file modifies vLLM (Apache-2.0); the vLLM copyright and SPDX lines in the files it changes are kept.

